      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The American College of Allergy, Asthma, and Immunology maintains that too many managed care organizations are blocking access to specialty clinicians, and as a result asthmatics are not getting appropriate care. In a new report, the group is urging a shift in policies and practice that it maintains will substantially reduce utilization and costs."},
